# L §4.5 (round 12): a row known after on is refused (LOAD-KNOWN), as a version is. (tally 2.2, 2.2-2: was
# L4_5_row_known_window_after_on, a row known in window(2026-02-01, 2026-11-30).)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input x: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  x = 1 known 2026-11-30

ask q: x
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KNOWN row x is known after the model's on date (m.tally:14)
